    "body": "## ✨ New feature description\r\nWe need users to consent to cookies if they're going to register for the site. I think we could just put a little message saying something to the effect of \"This site requires cookies if you're going to create an account. By submitting this form you're consenting, blah blah. {link to privacy policy}\" (Thanks EU!!)\r\n\r\n## ➕ Additional context\r\nhttps://secureprivacy.ai/why-you-need-a-cookie-banner-on-your-website/\r\n",
